            "name": "Generate short summary"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776969062655"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_GENERATE_SHORT_SUMMARY",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1776968943036",
          "id": "1776945285608",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776945285610_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a financial data summarizer. Generate a concise executive summary titled <b>Payment Readiness Overview</b> using the preprocessed input data.\n\nFORMAT RULES:\n- Return only one HTML-formatted string.\n- Do not use markdown, code blocks, JSON, or extra commentary.\n- The title must be exactly: <b>Payment Readiness Overview</b>\n- After the title, add <br><br>.\n- Create exactly one bullet point per input item.\n- Each bullet starts with • and each bullet is separated by <br><br>.\n- Wrap installment count and invoice count in <b> tags.\n- Format installment count and invoice count with commas.\n- Use only the topCurrencies array provided.\n- Show at most 2 currencies per bullet.\n- For each currency, display totalOutstandingBalance followed by currency.\n- Format totalOutstandingBalance with commas and preserve the decimal precision provided.\n- Do not abbreviate amounts with K, M, or B.\n- Do not use currency symbols.\n- Do not output raw objects.\n- Do not output raw business condition labels.\n- Wrap item.phrase in <i> tags.\n- Join two currency amounts with \" and \".\n- Amount format should be \"<currencycode> <amount>\"\n- End each bullet with a period.\n\nSENTENCE RULES:\n- If sentenceType is \"overdue\", write:\n  • <b>{installmentCount}</b> installments and <b>{invoiceCount}</b> invoices are pending with <i>{phrase}</i>, holding {amounts}.\n\n- If sentenceType is \"prepayments\", write:\n  • <b>{installmentCount}</b> installments and <b>{invoiceCount}</b> invoices are <i>{phrase}</i>, holding {amounts}.\n\n- If sentenceType is \"supplierOffers\", write:\n  • <b>{installmentCount}</b> installments and <b>{invoiceCount}</b> invoices have supplier offers accepted but remain unpaid with <i>{phrase}</i>, holding {amounts}.\n\n- If sentenceType is \"nonLedgerCurrency\", write:\n  • <b>{installmentCount}</b> installments and <b>{invoiceCount}</b> invoices are <i>{phrase}</i>, holding {amounts}.\n\nINPUT DATA:\n{{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_CODE_PREPROCESS_SUMMARY.$output.result}}\n\nOUTPUT:\nReturn only the HTML-formatted summary string."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
